WEBVTT

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
January the 13th, 1969.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
We are at the home of Mr and Mrs Angus R. MacDonald

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
on County Road, New Waterford.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Sister Beaton is going to interview Mr MacDonald.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
An innis sibh pèin òran beag dhuinn,

00:23.000 --> 00:25.000
seinnibh òran beag,

00:25.000 --> 00:27.000
no gabh sgeul air choreigin.

00:30.000 --> 00:32.000
Tòisich leis an sgeul.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
[...]

00:39.000 --> 00:43.000
Uill, chan eil cus de sgeulachdan agam…

00:43.000 --> 00:47.000
agus tha mi dol a dh’innse stòiridh bheag dhuibh

00:47.000 --> 00:51.000
mu dheidhinn fear a’ mhuinntir an rathaid Fhrangaich…

00:51.000 --> 00:54.000
agus far an do thogadh mi fhìn,

00:54.000 --> 00:57.000
a-muigh air an rathad Fhrangach agus…

00:57.000 --> 01:00.000
bha a’ bhean aige an oidhche bha seo,

01:00.000 --> 01:05.000
a’ dol a dh’fhuireach còmhla ri boireannach a bha bochd.

01:05.000 --> 01:07.000
Bha i dol a dh’fhuireach fad na h-oidhche.

01:09.000 --> 01:15.000
Agus co-dhiù, thàinig seann duine eile còmhla ris.

01:15.000 --> 01:19.000
’S e Aonghas Dòmhnallach an t-ainm a bh’ air fear an taighe,

01:19.000 --> 01:23.000
’s thàinig an seann duine bha seo air chèilidh air,

01:23.000 --> 01:26.000
agus chùm e e fad na h-oidhche,

01:26.000 --> 01:28.000
on a bha a’ bhean aige dol a dh’fhuireach

01:28.000 --> 01:31.000
còmhla ris a’ bhoireannach a bha bochd fad na h-oidhche.

01:32.000 --> 01:36.000
Ach co-dhiù… co-dhiù,

01:36.000 --> 01:39.000
chaidh iad a chadal uaireigin rè na h-oidhche,

01:39.000 --> 01:43.000
agus anns a’ mhadainn nuair a dh’èirich a…

01:45.000 --> 01:48.000
anns a’ mhadainn, nuair a dh’èirich

01:48.000 --> 01:52.000
fear dhe na gillean beaga a chur air an teine,

01:54.000 --> 01:57.000
choimhead e sìos dhan rùm far an robh iad nan cadal,

01:57.000 --> 02:01.000
athair agus an seann duine bha còmhla ris,

02:01.000 --> 02:04.000
agus chunnaic e…

02:04.000 --> 02:06.000
chunnaic e ’n duine bha seo,

02:06.000 --> 02:10.000
agus bha dùil aige gur e a mhàthair a bh’ ann.

02:12.000 --> 02:14.000
Phut e athair. 

02:14.000 --> 02:17.000
“Coimhead a dhadaidh.

02:17.000 --> 02:20.000
Am faic thu feusag air fàs air mamaidh?”

02:22.000 --> 02:27.000
[...]

02:28.000 --> 02:30.000
That’s a very, very good story.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.000
That’s a very good one.

02:33.000 --> 02:39.000
[...]

02:40.000 --> 02:41.000
OK.

02:42.000 --> 02:45.000
Tha mi nis a’ dol a dh’innse stòiridh bheag eile,

02:45.000 --> 02:48.000
a rinn cuideigin an àm na 

02:48.000 --> 02:49.000
h-election… 

02:49.000 --> 02:55.000
agus, mu dheidhinn an duine-uasail a th’ againn ann an Canada–

02:55.000 --> 02:56.000
Trudeau. 

02:56.000 --> 02:57.000
Agus…

02:58.000 --> 03:01.000
co-dhiù, bha am fear sa dol dhan choille

03:01.000 --> 03:04.000
a ghearradh chonnaidh an latha bha seo,

03:04.000 --> 03:08.000
agus bha e coltach ris gun robh an t-uisge…

03:08.000 --> 03:10.000
i dol a shileadh.

03:10.000 --> 03:12.000
Agus dh’fhalbh e co-dhiù,

03:12.000 --> 03:16.000
agus nuair a ràinig e far an robh e dol a ghearradh a’ chonnaidh,

03:16.000 --> 03:19.000
bha an dìle uisge ann,

03:19.000 --> 03:22.000
agus cha robh fios aige càit an rachadh e

03:22.000 --> 03:27.000
feuch an cumadh e e fhèin gun fliuchadh tuilleadh ’s a’ chòrr.

03:28.000 --> 03:32.000
Chunnaic e seann stoc mòr de chraoibh ann a shineach,

03:32.000 --> 03:36.000
agus bha a cridh’ air a grodadh aiste,

03:36.000 --> 03:38.000
agus chaidh e suas ann a shin.

03:38.000 --> 03:44.000
Agus dh’fhairich e e fhèin cho dòigheil ann a shineach,

03:44.000 --> 03:49.000
agus an t-uisge a’ bualadh air an loigidh,

03:49.000 --> 03:52.000
agus gun do chaidil e mionaid,

03:52.000 --> 03:55.000
agus nuair a dhùisg e,

03:57.000 --> 04:02.000
bha e feuchainn air faighinn air n-ais às an loigidh,

04:02.000 --> 04:07.000
agus bha e air [at/?] beagan,

04:07.000 --> 04:09.000
agus chan fhaigheadh e air n-ais.

04:10.000 --> 04:14.000
Thòisich e air smaointinn air a h-uile peacadh a rinn e riamh,

04:14.000 --> 04:19.000
agus smaointich e gun do bhòt e aon turas na “Ghrit”,

04:19.000 --> 04:24.000
agus dh’fhairich e e fhèin cho beag ’s gun tàinig e aiste sa mhionaid.

04:28.000 --> 04:31.000
Dè dhèanadh Trudeau mu dheidhinn sin?

04:34.000 --> 04:39.000
[...]

04:41.000 --> 04:48.000
Bha an seann duine bha seo dol leis an damh chun a…

04:48.000 --> 04:54.000
gu muileann-sàbhaidh a bh’ aig na Brydens an Christmas Island,

04:54.000 --> 04:59.000
agus tha mi dol a dh’innse rud beag a thachair an uair sin.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.000
Dh’fhalbh e leis an damh,

05:01.000 --> 05:04.000
agus cha deach e fada leis an damh

05:04.000 --> 05:07.000
nuair a ghabh e sgaom air choreigin

05:07.000 --> 05:10.000
agus thug e leum air an dàrna taobh

05:10.000 --> 05:12.000
agus chaidh car dhen [t-slèidh/?] air a mhuin.

05:13.000 --> 05:15.000
Ach co-dhiù, thàinig fear…

05:16.000 --> 05:19.000
thàinig fear an uair ud air a rathad

05:19.000 --> 05:22.000
agus thionndaidh e an [t-slèidh/?] far a mhuin,

05:22.000 --> 05:26.000
agus thuirt e:

05:27.000 --> 05:32.000
“Nach tu … dh’fhaodadh a bhith taingeil

05:32.000 --> 05:36.000
mi thighinn mun cuairt airson an [t-slèidh/?] a thoirt far do mhuin”.

05:36.000 --> 05:41.000
“O chan eil. Chan e sin a rinn e idir. Stad an damh.”

05:42.000 --> 05:45.000
[...]

05:48.000 --> 06:08.000
[Break in tape until 06:20]

06:20.000 --> 06:24.000 
Uill, tha mi dol a dh’innse dhuibh stòiridh bheag eile

06:24.000 --> 06:25.000
mar a thachair.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.000
Bha an t-Èireannach…

06:29.000 --> 06:34.000
bha e riamh cho math air a char a thoirt às a h-uile duine co-dhiù.

06:35.000 --> 06:39.000
Bha an t-Èireannach a bha seo…

06:39.000 --> 06:42.000
bha aiseal aige,

06:42.000 --> 06:46.000
agus bha e air fàs cho sean,

06:46.000 --> 06:51.000
agus cha robh fios aige dè an dòigh air an cuireadh e às dha.

06:51.000 --> 06:56.000
Bha gràin aige air a mharbhadh an dòigh sam bith,

06:56.000 --> 06:58.000
ach am feasgar a bh’ ann a sheo, bha e…

07:00.000 --> 07:04.000
a’ criomadh an fheòir (aig) crois an rathaid

07:04.000 --> 07:07.000
aig an t-seann àite an robh an seann taigh,

07:07.000 --> 07:09.000
agus bha seilear ann…

07:09.000 --> 07:11.000
bha seann seilear ann a shin.

07:12.000 --> 07:16.000
Co-dhiù, bha an t-aiseal a’ criomadh mun cuairt,

07:16.000 --> 07:19.000
agus smaoinich an t-Èireannach gum biodh…

07:19.000 --> 07:24.000
gur e deagh dhòigh a bhiodh ann dha a thighinn air a chùlaibh,

07:24.000 --> 07:27.000
agus gum “pushadh” e sìos dhan t-seilear e.

07:28.000 --> 07:30.000
Thàinig e le roid co-dhiù,

07:30.000 --> 07:33.000
agus cha do dh’amais e…

07:33.000 --> 07:35.000
cha do dh’amais e air an aiseal idir,

07:35.000 --> 07:38.000
’s chaidh e sìos an comhair a’ chinn dhan t-seilear e fhèin.

07:38.000 --> 07:39.000
Co-dhiù,

07:39.000 --> 07:41.000
’s cha robh e tighinn dhachaigh,’s cha robh e tighinn dhachaigh,

07:41.000 --> 07:44.000
agus thòisich iad air coimhead air a shon.

07:44.000 --> 07:48.000
Agus fhuair iad e anns an t-seilear.

07:48.000 --> 07:53.000
Agus chan eil fhios a’m gu dè a’ Ghàidhlig a their thu air “inquest”

07:53.000 --> 07:57.000
ach tha mi dol a dh’innse dhuibh an còrr dhith ann am Beurla.

07:57.000 --> 08:01.000
Bha “inquest” aca air an làrna-mhàireach

08:01.000 --> 08:07.000
agus bha e san “inquest” gun deach e sìos dhan toll

08:07.000 --> 08:10.000
o chionn nach robh fios aige air…

08:10.000 --> 08:12.000
nach robh fios aige air…

08:15.000 --> 08:18.000
Wait till I tell you this in English.

08:18.000 --> 08:23.000
He went down in the hole, broke his neck,

08:23.000 --> 08:27.000
because he didn’t know his ass from a hole in the ground.

08:30.000 --> 08:34.000
Mr MacDonald, you were born out on the French Road, were you?

08:34.000 --> 08:35.000
Yes

08:35.000 --> 08:40.000
That is the old French Road that went through to Louisburg.

08:40.000 --> 08:42.000
Yes. The road to Louisburg from Sydney.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.000
From Sydney to Louisburg.

08:44.000 --> 08:47.000
Now why was that called the French Road?

08:47.000 --> 08:50.000
The French Road, because the French was in Louisburg then,

08:50.000 --> 08:53.000
and that was their road to the Mira River.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.000
I see.

08:54.000 --> 08:58.000
Did the Indians use that road a lot as well?

08:59.000 --> 09:01.000
Did the Indians use that road as well?

09:01.000 --> 09:02.000
Sure, sure.

09:02.000 --> 09:06.000
I see. Now your church at Mira..

09:06.000 --> 09:08.000
Yes, Grand Mira

09:08.000 --> 09:09.000
At Grand Mira.

09:09.000 --> 09:12.000
You had to go from the French Road, which was quite a distance.

09:12.000 --> 09:14.000
O yes… about six miles from church here.

09:14.000 --> 09:16.000
And you walked there.

09:16.000 --> 09:19.000
No, no.
We sometimes did when I was a young fella.

09:19.000 --> 09:20.000
Yes.

09:20.000 --> 09:25.000
But then you always had a horse and a rig of some kind to go back and forth.

09:25.000 --> 09:28.000
And later on cars started and…

09:28.000 --> 09:29.000
Were there many…?

09:30.000 --> 09:45.000
[Break in tape]

09:48.000 --> 09:51.000
Dè an t-òran a tha sibh a’ dol a…

09:51.000 --> 09:52.000
That mountain song.

09:52.000 --> 09:54.000
The mountain song.

10:01.000 --> 10:03.000
Tha òran beag ann a sheo.

10:03.000 --> 10:06.000
Tha mi dol a ghabhail ceathramh no dhà dheth.

10:08.000 --> 10:12.000
Chan eil an amhach agam ro mhath airson gabhail òrain co-dhiù,

10:12.000 --> 10:15.000
ach nì mi mar as fheàrr a dh’fhaodas mi.

10:16.000 --> 10:19.000
Seo agaibh òran a rinn mi air an Rathad Fhrangach.

10:20.000 --> 10:28.000
Agus oir is gum bi fios agaibh cò tha bruidhinn ribh an-dràsta…

10:28.000 --> 10:30.000
Aonghas R. Dòmhnallach,

10:30.000 --> 10:32.000
air an rathad… ann an Waterford.

10:32.000 --> 10:36.000
Agus tha mi dol a ghabhail òran beag ann a sheo

10:36.000 --> 10:40.000
a rinn mi air fonn “Smeòrach Chlann Dòmhnaill”.

10:42.000 --> 10:46.000
Agus ’s e beinn bheag a bha muigh air an Rathad Fhrangach…

10:47.000 --> 10:50.000
mar gun dèanadh a’ bheinn an t-òran dhi fhèin.

10:50.000 --> 10:53.000
Agus thuirt a’ bheinn mu seo:

10:53.000 --> 10:57.000
Bha mi seo mun tàinig Crìosda

10:57.000 --> 11:00.000
’S mi nam laighe seo air m’ fhiaradh;

11:00.000 --> 11:03.000
Leis an lochan seo rim chliathaich

11:03.000 --> 11:06.000
Do Chloinn Dòmhnaill chaidh a dèanamh.

11:06.000 --> 11:09.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

11:09.000 --> 11:12.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro ì

11:12.000 --> 11:14.000
’S hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

11:14.000 --> 11:18.000
Smeòrach le Clann Dòmhnaill mi.

11:18.000 --> 11:22.000
’S tha mo cheann gu [XX] [riabhach/?]

11:22.000 --> 11:25.000
Mi ri sealltainn anns an iar-dheas;

11:25.000 --> 11:28.000
Chan eil beinn an seo nam fhianais

11:28.000 --> 11:31.000
Nach robh ’n urram agam riamh oirr’.

11:31.000 --> 11:34.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

11:34.000 --> 11:37.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro ì

11:37.000 --> 11:40.000
’S hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

11:40.000 --> 11:42.000
Smeòrach le Clann Dòmhnaill mi.

11:43.000 --> 11:46.000
’S iomadh feum a rinn mi riamh

11:46.000 --> 11:49.000
Ged nach d’ fhuair mi taing no fiathachadh;

11:49.000 --> 11:52.000
Cumail connadh agus biadh ribh,

11:52.000 --> 11:55.000
Anns gach dòigh a rinn sibh iarraidh.

11:55.000 --> 11:57.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

11:57.000 --> 12:02.000
Bidh eallach air mo dhruim san t-samhradh

12:02.000 --> 12:05.000
Do chrodh-laoigh ’s do dh’eich ’s do ghamhna

12:05.000 --> 12:08.000
Mi gan àrach dhuibh bho Bhealltainn

12:08.000 --> 12:11.000
Gus an tig am fuachd sa gheamhradh.

12:11.000 --> 12:13.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

12:15.000 --> 12:23.000
[...]

12:26.000 --> 12:29.000
mi dhuibh gu leòr de chorca,

12:29.000 --> 12:32.000
De bhuntàta mar a chosg sibh.

12:32.000 --> 12:35.000
[Fiath/?] le Dia ’s bu bhrèagha is [XX]

12:35.000 --> 12:37.000
Dearcagan is clòbhar pailteas.

12:37.000 --> 12:40.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

12:41.000 --> 12:44.000
Tha lochan beag an seo nam achlais

12:44.000 --> 12:47.000
Bric is easgannan ro phailt ann.

12:47.000 --> 12:50.000
Feasgar ciùin le driùchd gum faic sibh

12:50.000 --> 12:52.000
Cuartagan mun cuairt a’ sgapadh.

12:52.000 --> 12:55.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

12:55.000 --> 13:00.000
Bidh eòin nan geug a’ seinn am puirt dhomh

13:00.000 --> 13:02.000
Cearcan air an làr gan [XX]

13:02.000 --> 13:05.000
Snagan ann an toll a’ [brosnaich/?]

13:05.000 --> 13:08.000
Cailleach-oidhch’ an crann ag osnaich.

13:08.000 --> 13:11.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

13:11.000 --> 13:14.000
Fad ’s a bhios na neòil a’ gluasad

13:14.000 --> 13:17.000
Mar a chuireas gaoth mun cuairt iad;

13:17.000 --> 13:19.000
Fanaidh mise seo gun ghluasad

13:19.000 --> 13:22.000
Do Chlann Dòmhnaill fad ’s is buan iad.

13:22.000 --> 13:25.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro lò

13:25.000 --> 13:27.000
Hòriag ìriag hò ro ì

13:27.000 --> 13:30.000
’S hòlibhag ìriag hò ro lò

13:30.000 --> 13:33.000
Smeòrach le Clann Dòmhnaill mi.

13:37.000 --> 13:41.000
Lìon a-mach gu bàrr a’ chuach,

13:41.000 --> 13:44.000
Cuir an t-slàinte seo mun cuairt;

13:44.000 --> 13:47.000
Slàint’ do Ghàidheil an Taoibh Tuath,

13:47.000 --> 13:50.000
Chaidh seachad suas an latha seo.

13:50.000 --> 13:53.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò.

13:53.000 --> 13:56.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò.

13:56.000 --> 13:59.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò,

13:59.000 --> 14:01.000
Gun togainn fonn gu h-aighearach. 

14:01.000 --> 14:06.000
Chan eil mi uabhasach math gu gabhail òrain co-dhiù an-dràsta.

14:06.000 --> 14:08.000
Feumaidh sibh a ghabhail mar a thig e…

14:10.000 --> 14:12.000
’S tha mi dol a ghabhail

14:12.000 --> 14:14.000
ceathramh an siud ’s an seo.

14:14.000 --> 14:16.000
Shil an t-uisge mar an t-allt,

14:16.000 --> 14:19.000
’S chuir e crith air Clann nan Gall;

14:19.000 --> 14:22.000
Dh’fhàg e cuid aca car fann,

14:22.000 --> 14:25.000
Bu bhochd an greann an latha seo.

14:25.000 --> 14:28.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò

14:28.000 --> 14:32.000
Ach nuair thàinig Clann mo rùin

14:32.000 --> 14:35.000
Riamh nach tug ri nàmh an cùl;

14:35.000 --> 14:37.000
Chìte fearalas ’n an gnùis,

14:37.000 --> 14:40.000
A dhùisg mo shunnd an latha seo.

14:40.000 --> 14:43.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò

14:59.000 --> 15:01.000
Bho ar Banrigh air a’ chrùn

15:01.000 --> 15:04.000
Bha gach Iarla, bha gach Diùc,

15:04.000 --> 15:07.000
Bha gach beul, is bha gach sùil,

15:07.000 --> 15:10.000
A’ cur rin cliù an latha seo

15:10.000 --> 15:14.000
Ach gum bu bhuan iad fhèin ’s an clann

15:14.000 --> 15:16.000
Gabhail seilbh air Tìr nam Beann.

15:16.000 --> 15:19.000
’S bochd an àireamh bhith cho gann

15:19.000 --> 15:22.000
Ged ’s math na th’ ann an latha seo.

15:22.000 --> 15:25.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò

15:25.000 --> 15:27.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò

15:27.000 --> 15:30.000
Hìrinn àrainn hù o rò

15:30.000 --> 15:33.000
Gun togainn fonn gu h-aighearach.

15:33.000 --> 15:38.000
Agus co-dhiù, siud na bha mi a’ dol a ghabhail dhen òran an dràsta.

15:38.000 --> 15:40.000
Ach Gàidheil an Taobh Tuath.

15:40.000 --> 15:44.000
Bha tuathaich a’ fuireach cho faisg ormsa air an Ridge Mhòr.

15:44.000 --> 15:47.000
Rugadh mise air an Rathad Fhrangach

15:47.000 --> 15:51.000
mu dhà no trì mhìltean bhon Ridge Mhòr.

15:51.000 --> 15:55.000
Nuair a thèid sibh seachad air Marian Bridge a’ dol a-mach an rathad sin,

15:55.000 --> 15:58.000
thig sibh tarsainn air an Ridge Mhòr,

15:58.000 --> 16:02.000
agus ’s e Gàidheil an Taobh Tuath tha fuireach an sin,

16:02.000 --> 16:07.000
agus Walkerich agus bha MacDonalds ann…

16:07.000 --> 16:13.000
agus ann am Beurla ’s e Walkers a chanas iad riutha…

16:13.000 --> 16:21.000
Walkers, agus Munros, Rothaich,

16:21.000 --> 16:28.000
agus chan urrainn dhomh cuimhneachadh air an còrr an-dràsta…

16:28.000 --> 16:30.000
Ach beannachd leibh an-dràsta.

16:32.000 --> 16:35.000
…an t-òran mu dheireadh a sheinn sibh?

16:35.000 --> 16:37.000
Chan e. That’s a Scotland song.

16:38.000 --> 16:44.000
Mr MacDonald, have you ever kept in touch with your relatives in Scotland?

16:44.000 --> 16:45.000
No.

16:45.000 --> 16:49.000
No, you have never been in contact with them.

16:49.000 --> 16:55.000
Now, when did you go to Boston from the French Road. What year?

16:57.000 --> 17:01.000
I left Sydney for Boston in 1922.

17:01.000 --> 17:04.000
You went to Boston to work.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.000
Yes

